tm⇇
	⎕systemInfo→os≡'mingw32'⍰"{int,int,int,int,int,int,int,int,int}"⍠
	⎕systemInfo→os≡'darwin' ⍰"{int,int,int,int,int,int,int,int,int,str,long}"⍠
	                         "{int,int,int,int,int,int,int,int,int,long,str}"⋄
LocalTime⇇⊐(⎕FFI ("*"⍪tm)‿"localtime"‿"*u64") ⍝ u64 is probably large enough to cover all possible sizes of time_t

now←'u64'⎕ffi→New⌊⎕unix ⋄
⎕←⊃(LocalTime now)→Peek 0 ⋄
⎕ffi→Free now
